OL,3,GNEWSARAF pilots who ejected moments
OL,4,Abefore crash expected to make full
OL,5,Arecovery
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo pilots, a trainee and an
OL,8,Fexperienced professional, who ejected
OL,9,Fand parachuted out of their plane
OL,10,Fmoments before it crashed are expected
OL,11,Fto make a full recovery, the RAF has
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FThe Hawk T2 aircraft had been flying
OL,15,Fout of the RAF Valley station on
OL,16,FAnglesey on Wednesday when it plummeted
OL,17,Fto the ground in the nearby
OL,18,FPencarnisiog area.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
PN,43102
