OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARAF pilots who ejected moments
OL,4,Abefore crash expected to make full
OL,5,Arecovery
OL,6,
OL,7,FHawk operations have been paused by the
OL,8,FRAF as a "precautionary measure" while
OL,9,Finvestigations into the crash are
OL,10,Fongoing - the Red Arrows are included
OL,11,Fin the pause as the aerobatics display
OL,12,Fteam use the T1.
OL,14,FOn Thursday, the RAF said the two
OL,15,Fpilots, who were treated for minor
OL,16,Finjuries, are "doing well" and are
OL,17,F"expected to make a full recovery".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
